  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Leatherhead is twelve miles from Maybury Hill. We were there by nine.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 5.28
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "narrators_wife",
      "text": "Must you go back tonight?",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 7.75,
      "seconds": 3.03
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "His cart was promised back by midnight.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 11.48,
      "seconds": 3.06
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "And I wanted to be in at the death.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 16.75,
      "seconds": 2.89
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Past Ockham a red glow crept up the sky.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 21.875,
      "seconds": 3.98
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A thread of green fire fell into a field. The third falling star.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 28.083,
      "seconds": 5.34
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Steady! Steady, boy!",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 35.625,
      "seconds": 2.29
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Something was striding down the far slope of the hill.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 40.125,
      "seconds": 4.39
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It came on like a milking stool, tilted and bowled along.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 46.75,
      "seconds": 4.56
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then the pines ahead snapped aside, and a second one came at me.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 53.542,
      "seconds": 4.42
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I wrenched him round. The cart went over, and I into a pool.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 60.167,
      "seconds": 4.03
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The horse lay dead, poor brute.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 66.417,
      "seconds": 2.84
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It went striding by me, a tentacle round a young pine.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 71.458,
      "seconds": 4.25
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Its hood swung to and fro like a head. Then it howled.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 77.917,
      "seconds": 5.78
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Half a mile off, the two of them stooped over the third cylinder.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 85.917,
      "seconds": 4.26
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I should have gone back to her. I went on toward home.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 92.417,
      "seconds": 4.06
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Is someone there? Are you hurt?",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 98.708,
      "seconds": 2.79
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A man blundered into me, and ran.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 102.198,
      "seconds": 2.98
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Near the top I stumbled on something soft. Broadcloth, and boots.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 107.417,
      "seconds": 5.9
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I had never touched a dead man. I turned him over.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 115.542,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The landlord of the Spotted Dog. I had taken his cart.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 121.458,
      "seconds": 3.87
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I stepped over him and pushed on up the hill.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 128.25,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Down toward the bridge there were voices, and running feet.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 134.958,
      "seconds": 4.56
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_hussar",
      "text": "Down to the bridge, all of you! Keep moving!",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 143.042,
      "seconds": 3.06
    }
  ],
  "plan": "cb8e91a86f309ac0"
}